536
00:33:43,938 --> 00:33:46,566
-Diego!
-Find the shooter!

537
00:33:46,649 --> 00:33:48,026
[crowd screaming]

538
00:33:49,986 --> 00:33:51,779
-Diego!
-Diego!

539
00:33:52,697 --> 00:33:53,906
Diego!

540
00:33:55,658 --> 00:33:57,493
-Diego!
-Diego!

541
00:33:57,577 --> 00:33:59,203
-Diego!
-Diego!

542
00:34:00,204 --> 00:34:01,497
[Julio] Let's go!

543
00:34:01,581 --> 00:34:03,624
[crowd screaming]

544
00:34:03,708 --> 00:34:05,710
Help! Diego!

545
00:34:07,712 --> 00:34:11,174
Help! Somebody, help!

546
00:34:11,257 --> 00:34:12,592
Help him! Diego!

547
00:34:12,675 --> 00:34:14,343
Lift him up!

548
00:34:14,969 --> 00:34:16,345
Find the shooter!

549
00:34:16,596 --> 00:34:18,848
[overlapping voices]

550
00:34:19,140 --> 00:34:20,475
Find the shooter!

551
00:34:23,061 --> 00:34:25,855
[crowd screaming]

552
00:34:27,523 --> 00:34:30,026
[dramatic music playing]

553
00:34:47,293 --> 00:34:48,836
[no audible dialogue]

554
00:34:54,717 --> 00:34:57,095
[dramatic music continues]

555
00:35:28,084 --> 00:35:29,544
[no audible dialogue]

556
00:35:39,762 --> 00:35:41,597
Get out of the way!

557
00:35:41,681 --> 00:35:43,850
Move! Move!

558
00:35:43,933 --> 00:35:44,976
Out of the way!

559
00:35:45,059 --> 00:35:46,894
[crowd screaming]

560
00:35:47,520 --> 00:35:50,439
[overlapping voices]

561
00:35:52,817 --> 00:35:54,318
