[unintelligible]

563
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:04,704
[clamor continues]

564
00:36:15,381 --> 00:36:18,634
[somber music playing]

565
00:36:48,497 --> 00:36:51,209
[tense music playing]

566
00:36:54,295 --> 00:36:57,256
Keep your eyes on the road, woman.

567
00:36:57,340 --> 00:37:00,927
If you want to die,
then leave me out of it.

568
00:37:01,844 --> 00:37:03,930
Where do we go now, Papa?

569
00:37:04,013 --> 00:37:07,016
Everyone hates us.
We've got nowhere to run.

570
00:37:07,099 --> 00:37:08,935
If you don't stop panicking,

571
00:37:09,018 --> 00:37:10,519
then they really will catch up to us.

572
00:37:10,603 --> 00:37:12,021
This isn't like your favorite TV show,

573
00:37:12,104 --> 00:37:15,066
where they're all talk and no action.

574
00:37:16,108 --> 00:37:18,194
But sure. Keep talking.

575
00:37:18,277 --> 00:37:21,405
For once, help me think.

576
00:37:21,489 --> 00:37:23,115
Where should we go?

577
00:37:24,700 --> 00:37:25,868
Think hard!

578
00:37:30,289 --> 00:37:32,375
Oh, my. Never mind, Emilia.

579
00:37:32,875 --> 00:37:34,919
I never expected you to answer.

580
00:37:36,087 --> 00:37:37,463
Just drive.

581
00:37:37,546 --> 00:37:39,507
I already know where to go.

582
00:37:40,132 --> 00:37:42,635
I know where you want to go, Papa.

583
00:37:42,718 --> 00:37:44,553
I'm not as dumb as you think.

584
00:37:44,637 --> 00:37:47,306
[tense music continues]

585
00:38:00,486 --> 00:38:03,197
[somber music playing]

586
00:38:04,699 --> 00:38:05,741
Diego.

587
00:38:13,958 --> 00:38:15,835
-Diego.
-Ma'am, please stay here.

588
00:38:15,918 --> 00:38:18,629
[somber music continues]

589
00:38:49,910 --> 00:38:52,830
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
instrumental playing]

590
00:39:16,395 --> 00:39:20,274
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
by Joey Ayala playing]

591
00:40:06,904 --> 00:40:09,323
<i>I'm begging You, Lord.</i>

592
00:40:10,825 --> 00:40:12,785
<i>Please save Diego.</i>

593
00:40:14,412 --> 00:40:16,831
<i>Please save my husband</i>

594
00:40:16,914 --> 00:40:19,458
<i>and the governor of this province.</i>

595
00:40:19,542 --> 00:40:22,461
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
continues playing]

596
00:40:41,063 --> 00:40:43,774
<i>Our story won't end here.</i>

597
00:40:46,318 --> 00:40:49,029
<i>Our dreams won't end here.</i>

598
00:40:51,615 --> 00:40:54,118
<i>This can't be the end.</i>

599
00:40:54,201 --> 00:40:57,455
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
continues playing]

600
00:41:15,222 --> 00:41:16,974
Mrs. Lily Torillo.

601
00:41:24,190 --> 00:41:27,943
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
continues playing]

602
00:42:02,811 --> 00:42:04,313
[music stops]

603
00:42:04,396 --> 00:42:05,564
Diego?

604
00:42:11,070 --> 00:42:12,238
Diego?

605
00:42:16,492 --> 00:42:17,701
Diego!

606
00:42:22,540 --> 00:42:23,749
Diego!

607
00:42:27,211 --> 00:42:28,254
Diego?

608
00:42:30,214 --> 00:42:31,298
Diego?

609
00:42:32,466 --> 00:42:35,135
Diego, no. This can't be!

610
00:42:35,219 --> 00:42:36,762
This isn't happening!

611
00:42:36,845 --> 00:42:39,640
You can't do this to me, Diego!

612
00:42:40,224 --> 00:42:41,392
Diego!

613
00:42:42,309 --> 00:42:43,602
Diego!

614
00:42:43,686 --> 00:42:45,729
You can't do this to me!

615
00:42:45,813 --> 00:42:47,940
You can't die on me!

616
00:42:49,149 --> 00:42:50,234
Diego!

617
00:42:50,526 --> 00:42:53,237
You can't do this to me!

618
00:42:54,405 --> 00:42:55,531
Diego!

619
00:42:55,614 --> 00:42:57,116
[sobbing]

620
00:42:59,326 --> 00:43:01,787
[wailing]

621
00:43:03,122 --> 00:43:05,499
This can't be happening!

622
00:43:07,418 --> 00:43:11,589
You can't just leave me!
You can't leave me!

623
00:43:11,964 --> 00:43:15,009
You said you wouldn't leave me!

624
00:43:17,970 --> 00:43:19,722
[sobbing]

625
00:43:19,805 --> 00:43:21,348
This can't be!

626
00:43:21,432 --> 00:43:22,766
Don't do this!

627
00:43:22,850 --> 00:43:25,311
Please, Diego! Don't do this to me!

628
00:43:25,394 --> 00:43:27,229
Please, please!

629
00:43:27,313 --> 00:43:29,189
Diego, please!

630
00:43:29,273 --> 00:43:30,357
Diego!

631
00:43:31,692 --> 00:43:33,235
Diego, no! Wake up!

632
00:43:33,319 --> 00:43:36,113
You can't die! Not like this!

633
00:43:36,196 --> 00:43:38,657
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
by Joey Ayala playing]

634
00:43:38,741 --> 00:43:41,243
[sobbing]

635
00:43:51,837 --> 00:43:53,589
Diego!

636
00:43:54,423 --> 00:43:55,924
Diego!

637
00:43:57,217 --> 00:43:59,637
How about me, Diego?!

638
00:44:00,220 --> 00:44:02,556
How about me?

639
00:44:02,640 --> 00:44:05,643
Why did you leave me?!

640
00:44:06,685 --> 00:44:10,314
You said you wouldn't leave me!

641
00:44:11,732 --> 00:44:13,025
[sobs]

642
00:44:17,446 --> 00:44:21,533
Diego, please! Please! Please! Please!

643
00:44:21,617 --> 00:44:23,744
Please, this can't be real.

644
00:44:23,827 --> 00:44:25,537
This isn't happening.

645
00:44:25,621 --> 00:44:27,665
Wake up, please.

646
00:44:27,748 --> 00:44:28,749
Please, Diego.

647
00:44:28,832 --> 00:44:30,000
Diego.

648
00:44:30,542 --> 00:44:31,502
Diego.

649
00:44:31,585 --> 00:44:34,296
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
continues playing]

650
00:44:42,513 --> 00:44:43,722
[Lily] <i>Diego.</i>

651
00:44:48,268 --> 00:44:49,645
<i>Diego.</i>

652
00:44:54,066 --> 00:44:55,526
