664
00:47:52,828 --> 00:47:54,329
Diego!

665
00:47:55,455 --> 00:47:56,790
No!

666
00:47:58,750 --> 00:47:59,960
Diego!

667
00:48:00,043 --> 00:48:02,588
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
by Joey Ayala playing]

668
00:48:42,002 --> 00:48:45,672
["Walang Hanggang Paalam"
