672
00:49:26,713 --> 00:49:28,131
<i>No one else!</i>

673
00:49:28,215 --> 00:49:32,344
<i>Definitely not that dead bastard!</i>

674
00:49:32,427 --> 00:49:34,846
[Camia] <i>No matter how grave</i>
<i>their crime was,</i>

675
00:49:34,930 --> 00:49:37,933
